<title>INDIA: Indian 364-day treasury bill cut-off unchanged.</title>
<headline>Indian 364-day treasury bill cut-off unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Wednesday it set a cut-off price of 88.80 rupees at the fortnightly auction of 364-day treasury bills, unchanged from the last auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 12.65 percent.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 12 bids for 2.43 billion rupees, of which it accepted six for 1.95 billion.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
